ry time I see your face.”\n\nThe successor, her husband, is the head of the division...!\n\n‘Ugh, I just wanted to heal him and escape, but this isn’t going to work.’\n\nSigh. There’s no helping it. Until the female lead shows up, should I try helping out this hopeless family a bit?\n\n“Father-in-law, at this rate, you’ll ruin the family!! I’m so embarrassed, I could die!!!”\n\nAnd so, Letty managed to get the lazy father-in-law to start thinking like a hardworking ant,\n\n“Hubby, your heart is racing again? Don’t break things and hold Letty’s hand.”\nCrash! Bang!\n“Ahhh~ The young master is destroying the mansion again!”\n\nThe attempt to reform her husband failed.","year":2024,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e8f21930-f6d4-416c-a990-c87de40954da/9f67e7eb-0ab8-4c1e-93a0-27e1a45ae5c6.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","fr"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":7.94,"follows":431,"listAt":"2026-10-20T13:04:05.189Z","chapters":[{"id":"4ac11920-f456-4cd5-926d-f02f2148a0ab","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2025-01-10T22:40:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6ce9e1be-cd6d-40b3-9593-5a301a9bdf23","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2024-12-14T23:32:53+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:31:59.259Z"},"f4337aad-792f-4b45-b391-f83098c7c5f2":{"id":"f4337aad-792f-4b45-b391-f83098c7c5f2","title":"Medabot Navi","altTitle":"メダロット・ナビ","description":null,"year":2001,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Sci-Fi","Mecha"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f4337aad-792f-4b45-b391-f83098c7c5f2/5246c097-04db-421d-b5c0-11b6aaf824dd.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es-la","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":10,"follows":33,"listAt":"2026-10-20T13:03:08.510Z","chapters":[{"id":"e4572